{"from":"2:1","body":"<p><ref to=\"2TH.2.1\">1</ref> Paul urges them to continue stedfast in the truth received;<br/><ref to=\"2TH.2.3\">3</ref> shows that there shall be a departure from the faith,<br/><ref to=\"2TH.2.9\">9</ref> and a discovery of Antichrist, before the day of the Lord come;<br/><ref to=\"2TH.2.15\">15</ref> and thereupon repeats his former exhortation, and prays for them.<br/><br/><br/>we.<br/><ref to=\"ROM.12.1\">Ro 12:1</ref><br/>by the.<br/><ref to=\"1TH.4.14-1TH.4.16\">1Th 4:14-16</ref><br/>and by.<br/><ref to=\"GEN.49.10 MAT.24.31 MAT.25.32 MRK.13.27 EPH.1.10 1TH.3.13 1TH.4.17\">Ge 49:10; Mt 24:31; 25:32; Mr 13:27; Eph 1:10; 1Th 3:13; 4:17</ref><br/><ref to=\"2TI.4.1\">2Ti 4:1</ref></p>"}
